to their replies."},{"id":"881be2b4-3856-4093-a914-2c95066a2297","text":"These tools can help you win every argument – not in the unhelpful sense of beating your opponents but in the better sense of learning about the issues that divide people."},{"id":"bef42080-e9ce-40be-aad1-0db31d800ac7","text":"Learning why they disagree with us and learning to talk and work together with them."},{"id":"35683122-c40c-410c-a309-2af6e5eb0647","text":"If we readjust our view of arguments – from a verbal fight or tennis game to a reasoned exchange through which we all gain mutual respect, and understanding – then we change the very nature of what it means to “win” an argument."}],"currentSentenceIndex":0,"origin":"system"}'::jsonb,
