op of a new state levy."},{"id":"c9ffedc7-cb7d-496a-af76-e4ea791f7fa4","text":"Boston took things even further, requiring renters to register with the city’s Inspectional Services Department."},{"id":"b3f3cc35-dfa7-4ad5-a4e1-cdf6ef8112b7","text":"Hom said similar registration requirements could benefit struggling cities and towns, but “if we want to make a change in the housing market, the main one is we have to build a lot more.”"}],"currentSentenceIndex":0,"origin":"system"}'::jsonb,
